<title>USA: CCC seeks 40,000 tonnes U.S. wheat for Pakistan.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 40,000 tonnes U.S. wheat for Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 40,000 tonnes of U.S. No. 2 soft white wheat, maximum moisture 13.5 percent, under its export program for Pakistan.</p>
<p>Shipment period was slated for February 20 to March 15.</p>
<p>The CCC, part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said offers are due at 1400 CST on February 4.</p>
<p>All whole grain wheat bagged or bulk must be tested for vomitoxin, with a maximum permissible level of two parts per million.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
